# sample_controls: focus through the controls, each acted on with space.
# After each Tab the reader is asked what has the focus, as in the text
# walk (NVDA on the runner leaves some focus moves unsaid; its walkers
# elsewhere ask nothing), the focus event itself tested by test_uia.
key Tab
focus
key Tab
focus
key space
key Tab
focus
key space
key Tab
focus
key space
key Tab
focus
key Tab
focus
# Said by Orca, NVDA and VoiceOver alike.
expect Subtitles
expect checked
expect Sound
# The radio group, past the switch: a Tab stuck on it fails the walk.
expect Low
